    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "He, Zhang, Ren and Sun, \"Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition\", CVPR 2016. Claim: a deep plain network is harder to optimise and ends with a higher training error (the degradation problem); identity shortcuts that let each block learn a residual remove the problem. Recipe: two MLPs with 20 hidden layers of width 32 (Linear -> BatchNorm1d -> ReLU) on 5,000 MNIST images, SGD lr 0.05 with momentum 0.9 for 8 epochs; in the residual one each block from the second on adds its input back before the ReLU. Under seed 0 on a CPU the residual net reaches a training accuracy of 0.95 (test 0.91); the plain net of the same depth reaches 0.77 (test 0.76).\n\nHe、Zhang、Ren 與 Sun，〈Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition〉，CVPR 2016。論點：很深的一般網路比較難最佳化，最後的訓練誤差反而比較高（退化問題）；加上恆等捷徑、讓每個區塊只學殘差，就能解決這個問題。配方：兩個各有 20 個寬度 32 隱藏層（Linear -> BatchNorm1d -> ReLU）的 MLP，在 5,000 張 MNIST 影像上用 SGD（lr 0.05、momentum 0.9）訓練 8 個 epoch；殘差版從第二個區塊起，每個區塊在 ReLU 之前把自己的輸入加回來。在 CPU 上以種子 0 執行，殘差網路的訓練準確率是 0.95（測試 0.91）；同樣深度的一般網路是 0.77（測試 0.76）。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-data",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1000,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "MNIST ships with the repository under backend/data, so the run reads it from disk. DatasetSplit keeps a fixed 5,000 of the 60,000 training images; its own seed (0) picks them, so every arm trains on the same images through the one DataLoader.\n\nMNIST 隨專案放在 backend/data 底下，執行時直接從磁碟讀取。DatasetSplit 從 60,000 張訓練影像中固定留下 5,000 張，挑哪幾張由它自己的種子（0）決定，所以每一組都透過同一個 DataLoader 在同一批影像上訓練。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "dl-train",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 320,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-arms",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -300,
        "y": 400
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Each arm has its own SequentialModel node. One model node wired into two TrainingLoops would hand every loop the same weights, and each loop would continue from what the previous one left. The run seed (0, stored in the file) fixes the shuffle order, any dropout masks and each model's initial weights. Every node is seeded from the run seed and its own id, so the arms start from different draws of the same initialisation. With Persist weights between runs on (Settings > Training Behavior), a second Run continues from the trained weights; turn it off to repeat these numbers.\n\n每一組都有自己的 SequentialModel 節點。如果一個模型節點同時接到兩個 TrainingLoop，每個迴圈拿到的是同一份權重，後跑的會接著前一個留下的結果繼續訓練。執行種子（0，存在檔案裡）固定了洗牌順序、dropout 遮罩和每個模型的初始權重。每個節點的種子由執行種子和節點自己的 id 推得，所以各組的初始權重是同一種初始化方式下的不同抽樣。在設定 > 訓練行為中開啟「在多次執行間保留權重」時，第二次執行會從訓練過的權重繼續；關閉它才能重現這些數字。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model-plain",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -300,
        "y": 1400
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Open the layer editor on this node; it is in graph mode. Each block is Linear 32->32 -> BatchNorm1d -> Add -> ReLU, and the Add takes a second edge straight from the block's input: that edge is the identity shortcut. The first block (Linear 784->32) has no shortcut because its input and output widths differ. The plain model above has the same 20 blocks with no Add layers.\n\n在這個節點上打開圖層編輯器，它是圖模式。每個區塊是 Linear 32->32 -> BatchNorm1d -> Add -> ReLU，Add 另外有一條邊直接從區塊的輸入接過來，這條邊就是恆等捷徑。第一個區塊（Linear 784->32）的輸入和輸出寬度不同，所以沒有捷徑。上面那個一般模型有同樣的 20 個區塊，只是沒有 Add。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model-residual",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-train-acc",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1320,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Training accuracy is the number to compare: degradation is a failure to fit the training set, which overfitting cannot explain. The plain net's training loss ends at 0.79 and the residual net's at 0.27 after the same 8 epochs.\n\n要比較的是訓練準確率：退化是連訓練集都擬合不好，這無法用過擬合解釋。同樣訓練 8 個 epoch，一般網路的訓練損失停在 0.79，殘差網路是 0.27。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "dl-train",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 640,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
